{"name":"Ankhapur","status":"ok","title":"Ankhapur","pageId":36523,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Ankhapur\" title=\"Category:Maps of Ankhapur\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Ankhapur</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ankhapur the White<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-KP-p78_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KP-p78-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br/>Bloody Ankhapur<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-KP-p78_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KP-p78-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br/>The Boiled City<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-KP-p24_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KP-p24-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br/>City of Griffons<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p145_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p145-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br/>City of Knives<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-KP-p78_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KP-p78-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br/>The Princely City<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-KP-p24_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KP-p24-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br/>The White City<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-KP-p24_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KP-p24-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Lake_of_Steam_(region)\" title=\"Lake of Steam (region)\">Lake of Steam</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Interior_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Interior Faerûn\">interior Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Metropolis<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>, mainly <a href=\"/wiki/Chondathan\" title=\"Chondathan\">Chondathan</a> (Over 90%), <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halfling</a> and <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Dwarves\" title=\"Dwarves\">Dwarves</a> both appear here in the highest proportion in all of the Arnaden<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-pp125_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-pp125-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lathander\" title=\"Lathander\">Lathander</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Knight\" title=\"Red Knight\">Red Knight</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-pp148_6-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-pp148-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pearl\" title=\"Pearl\">Pearls</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p145_7-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p145-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>, trade, wagons, beast of burden, metalwork, wagon wheels, mirrors<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-pp147_8-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-pp147-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler's type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">King<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_4-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">33,514<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_4-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a><br/>29,000<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p145_7-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p145-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">King</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Janol_Famisso\" title=\"Janol Famisso\">Janol Famisso</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_4-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Ankhapur\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Ankhapur\">Inhabitants of  Ankhapur</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Ankhapur\" title=\"Category:Locations in Ankhapur\">Locations in  Ankhapur</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a class=\"newcategory\" href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Ankhapur\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Ankhapur\">Organizations in  Ankhapur</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a class=\"newcategory\" href=\"/wiki/Category:Events_in_Ankhapur\" title=\"Category:Events in Ankhapur\">Events in  Ankhapur</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a class=\"newcategory\" href=\"/wiki/Category:Food_and_drink_from_Ankhapur\" title=\"Category:Food and drink from Ankhapur\">Food and drink from  Ankhapur</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a class=\"newcategory\" href=\"/wiki/Category:Items_from_Ankhapur\" title=\"Category:Items from Ankhapur\">Items from  Ankhapur</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Ankhapur</b> was a city located in the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Lake_of_Steam_region\" title=\"Lake of Steam region\">Lake of Steam region</a> on the southern edge of <a href=\"/wiki/Interior_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Interior Faerûn\">interior Faerûn</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_4-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p145_7-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p145-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Legends\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Legends</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Temples_&amp;_Shrines\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Temples &amp; Shrines</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Inns_&amp;_Taverns\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inns &amp; Taverns</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Cuisine\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cuisine</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Novels\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Novels</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Novels_&amp;_Short_Stories\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ankhapur?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The city was primarily known for its <a href=\"/wiki/Pearl\" title=\"Pearl\">pearl</a> industry, which involved many of its citizens.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p145_7-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p145-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The <a href=\"/wiki/Mirror\" title=\"Mirror\">mirror</a> industry was also one of the cities traditional claims to fame. Vorbel wagon wheels were a specific type manufactured here, built as trebled thin metal wheels bolted together with their spokes offset for strength,sharing a common wooden rim and a replaceable cloth/rubber offset layer. A lot of trade bound for the <a href=\"/wiki/Shining_Sea\" title=\"Shining Sea\">Shining Sea</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Nagarr\" title=\"Nagarr\">Nagarr</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Nagawater\" title=\"Nagawater\">Nagawater</a> came down through the Ankh Road to be shipped from Ankhapur.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-pp147_8-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-pp147-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Legends\">Legends</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Legends\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ankhapur?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Legends\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There were a number of <a href=\"/wiki/Tressym\" title=\"Tressym\">tressym</a> in the city. Curiously, on the day before <a href=\"/wiki/Highsummer\" title=\"Highsummer\">Highsummer</a> each year, every tressym in the city mysteriously disappeared only to return three days later.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_4-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ankhapur?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ankhapur was originally settled as a military outpost of the <a href=\"/wiki/Jhaamdath\" title=\"Jhaamdath\">Jhaamdath</a> Empire around -5000DR, and is the only such city along the Lake of Steams northern coastline to have remained continuously settled throughout the ages. Unlike all other cities along the Arnaden, Ankhapur alone was not completely resettled by <a href=\"/wiki/Calishite\" title=\"Calishite\">Calishites</a>, having retained their Jhaamdathan roots and appearing more like a city of the Vilhon Reach or Tethyr.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-pp124_9-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-pp124-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In <a href=\"/wiki/1366_DR\" title=\"1366 DR\">1366 DR</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Manferic_III\" title=\"Manferic III\">Manferic III</a> ruled Ankhapur with an iron hand and a touch of sadism. He became a <a href=\"/wiki/Lich\" title=\"Lich\">lich</a> and sought to inhabit the body of <a href=\"/wiki/Janol_Famisso\" title=\"Janol Famisso\">Janol Famisso</a>, a bastard son of his. In his attempt, Manferic killed his other heirs while controlling Janol's body in order to inherit the throne from himself. However, thanks to a cleric of <a href=\"/wiki/Lathander\" title=\"Lathander\">Lathander</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lissa\" title=\"Lissa\">Lissa</a>, and others, Manferic was destroyed by Janol and his allies.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-HLb-p57_10-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HLb-p57-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>With no other heirs left, Janol took the crown.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-HLb-p57_10-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HLb-p57-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Temples_.26_Shrines\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Temples_&amp;_Shrines\">Temples &amp; Shrines</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Temples &amp; Shrines\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ankhapur?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Temples &amp; Shrines\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The House of Strategy, temple of the <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Knight\" title=\"Red Knight\">Red Knight</a> (referred to locally as the Red Lord or the Red Lady).</li>\n<li>The Temple of the Morninglord, temple of <a href=\"/wiki/Lathander\" title=\"Lathander\">Lathander</a>. While initially small. it had grown in prestige after being sponsored as King Janol's personal temple of choice.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-pp151_11-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-pp151-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Inns_.26_Taverns\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inns_&amp;_Taverns\">Inns &amp; Taverns</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inns &amp; Taverns\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ankhapur?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Inns &amp; Taverns\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Hoof and Shank, a sawdust floored Inn and Tavern renowned for its steaks, chops, strong brews, and eating/drinking contests.</li>\n<li>The Beholder's Arse, a less sophisticated Tavern by the docks, popular with sailors looking to drown their sorrows in a cracked earthen mug of grog or ale.</li>\n<li>The Brass Griffon, an exotic and higher quality venue staffed by attractive young <a href=\"/wiki/Calishite\" title=\"Calishite\">Calishites</a> of both sexes, offering authentic Calishite dishes, drinks, and entertainment.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-pp148_6-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-pp148-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cuisine\">Cuisine</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Cuisine\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ankhapur?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Cuisine\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ankhapuran_street_noodles\" title=\"Ankhapuran street noodles\">Ankhapuran street noodles</a> were a common street food consumed in Ankhapur.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-KP_12-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KP-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ankhapur?veaction=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i> <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ankhapur?veaction=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Novels\">Novels</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Novels\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ankhapur?veaction=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Novels\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<div class=\"block-indent\"><h4><span id=\"Novels_.26_Short_Stories\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Novels_&amp;_Short_Stories\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/King_Pinch\" title=\"King Pinch\">King Pinch</a></i></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.